  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unicef RRMP HAP 2011 DRC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Unicef RRMP HAP 2011 DRC, Rapid Response for      Movements of Populations Program, within the      Humanitarian Action plan 2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Multisektorst&#xF6;d till UNICEF program, RRMP; f&#xF6;r interflyktingar i &#xF6;stra DRC under 2011 och 2012. St&#xF6;det ing&#xE5;r i DRCs humanit&#xE4;ra apell f&#xF6;r 2011, Humanitarian Action plan 2011.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Unicef&apos;s Rapid Response for Movements of Populations (RRMP) in Eastern DR Congo with a contribution of 17 MSEK in 2011 and 17 MSEK in 2012, to be disbursed in two instalments. This is part of Sida&apos;s contributions supporting the Humanitarian Action Plan 2011 and 2012. RRMP supports seven NGO partners addressing WASH, Shelter/NFI and education/child protection needs of IDPs and returning population</narrative>
  </description>
